// Coloring Book 3.2 (creator 'JF[3').
// Its Universe XFCN emits one error line for an unknown selector, but one
// line per attribute bit for a recognized selector.  The startup script
// assumes fixed positions: deep GWorld support on line 61 and RAM on 64.
// Report absent features as zero so those fields retain their positions.
// Keep these overrides local; other applications rely on unknown selectors.
Gestalt('conn') = { 0, 0 };
Gestalt('hdwr') = { 0, 0 };
Gestalt('misc') = { 0, 0 };
Gestalt('os  ') = { 0, 0 };
Gestalt('powr') = { 0, 0 };
Gestalt('ppc ') = { 0, 0 };
Gestalt('prty') = { 0, 0 };
